# Weather Images API
#
# POST /images starts a job and returns an id immediately.
# The work happens in the background: ~40 weather stations,
# one image each, so allow 30-60 seconds before fetching.
#
# GET /images/{id} returns the generated image URLs.
@local = http://localhost:5271
@azure = https://weatherimg-api.agreeablepond-18b8b7df.swedencentral.azurecontainerapps.io

@host = {{azure}}

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### Start a job — returns a job id
POST {{host}}/images

### Fetch results for a job
@jobId = 0402c898-6bd5-4abc-82a7-3398b022c264
GET {{host}}/images/{{jobId}}